Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:54.78,info,,0,0,0,Scroll up;20;200;90;50,{\blur4\an3\i1\fs13\pos\1c&H0080FF&}支持着与难治之症作斗争的丈夫，\N\N\N靠出租车维持生计的献身妻子真美。\N\N\N医生建议我进行高额医疗，\N\N\N我抱着头。\N\N\N有一天，\N\N\N有钱的常客提出了代替治疗费的申请。\N\N\N为了紧急的支付而原谅了身体。\N\N\N连日的变态性指南。\N\N\N渐渐地真美开始贪图自己的快乐。\N\N\N丈夫不知道的样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.39,0:00:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}（羽田翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.85,0:00:26.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}醫生 我先生的病能治好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.21,0:00:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}治療方法有倒是有..
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.27,0:00:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}但這會需要很大筆醫療費啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.76,0:00:53.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}等等 這路不對啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.10,0:00:56.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}不是說在第二個信號燈右轉嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.89,0:01:00.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}非常抱歉 我馬上過去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.65,0:01:04.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}這都哪裏了啊 算了 停車吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.99,0:01:06.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.98,0:01:09.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}果然女司機就是靠不住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.18,0:01:21.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}真的非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.25,0:01:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}看你是個美女 就算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.46,0:01:26.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.59,0:01:54.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}（人妻的姐 在悖德高潮中獻身的妻子--羽田翼）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.97,0:02:08.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}還好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.96,0:02:19.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你做噩夢了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.16,0:02:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你回來了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.23,0:02:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我做了個不好的夢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.95,0:02:29.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}什麼樣的夢啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:32.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}真美你..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.54,0:02:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}放棄了我 和別的男人跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}說什麼呢 這怎麼可能嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}是個很真實的夢啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.90,0:02:49.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}真美你..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.83,0:02:55.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你被那傢伙上了 我卻只能眼睜睜看著
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.95,0:03:00.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我都有你了 怎麼可能還去跟其他人呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:03.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.81,0:03:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你工作的時間也只有一半了 都是因為我
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.09,0:03:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}現在還說這些幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:20.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}要快點好起來 才好再去工作啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.86,0:03:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}來 吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.32,0:03:40.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.19,0:03:44.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}小姐你也很辛苦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.00,0:03:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}一邊照顧生病的丈夫
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.08,0:03:52.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}一邊和艱難的生活做鬥爭
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:55.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}不容易啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.16,0:04:02.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}請你停那兒就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.19,0:04:16.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}零錢不用找了 就當小費吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.93,0:04:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}可我不能收您這麼多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:21.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.83,0:04:28.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}畢竟你也給我講了那麼多不輕易講給別人聽的事情嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.28,0:04:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}下次我還坐你車可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.88,0:04:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}當然可以 真是謝謝您了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.81,0:04:44.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}如果可以給我您的名片或者電話號碼的話 我會優先去接您的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.73,0:04:49.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}那期待我們下次相見
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.85,0:04:53.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}非常感謝
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.20,0:06:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}大橋先生 感謝您的聯繫 我來接您了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.90,0:06:38.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}很準時啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.89,0:06:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}可是我還沒有準備好啊 可以進來坐坐嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.29,0:06:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}既然如此 那我就在車裏等候您吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:52.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}車停到車庫去就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.71,0:06:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}今天我包了半天車 不用那麼急著走也行的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.42,0:07:01.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.47,0:07:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}真的不用那麼費心的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.08,0:07:15.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我正在泡咖啡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.86,0:07:16.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}啊 真不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:19.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}這是南美的名牌咖啡啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:40.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.17,0:07:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}啊 那個
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.19,0:07:54.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}是我結婚時的照片啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.03,0:07:59.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}那已經是很久以前事了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.99,0:08:01.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}很有男子氣對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:04.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}來 請
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.72,0:08:06.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}多謝
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.15,0:08:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}您夫人真漂亮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.42,0:08:25.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我兩口一直都過得很幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.31,0:08:29.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}但有一天她突然病倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.12,0:08:32.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}這樣 啊..
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.46,0:08:36.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}請
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.33,0:08:49.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}雖然我也想過再婚 可那些人全都只是看中我的財產罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.19,0:08:53.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我都這把年紀了 還孤單一人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.35,0:08:59.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}夫妻 是很難白頭偕老的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.46,0:09:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}所以 當我聽說你盡心照顧你先生之後
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.82,0:09:13.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}真是羨慕得很啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.04,0:15:58.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}果然很騷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.12,0:18:53.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你看來真的很累了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.38,0:18:59.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}都昏過去了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.43,0:19:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}這可不像話啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.67,0:19:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}穿得這麼風騷
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.32,0:19:16.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}怎能讓人不興奮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.24,0:19:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}這是幹什麼 等等 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:37.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}不要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.44,0:19:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}不要
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.69,0:19:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}請別這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.80,0:20:00.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你需要錢對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.17,0:20:05.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}錢 我自己 會想辦法掙的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.20,0:20:09.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}請別這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.19,0:20:12.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我會幫你的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.54,0:20:16.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}不用了 我要回去了 放開我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.56,0:20:30.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}那是你自己掙根本付不起的巨款吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.53,0:20:34.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}所以我會幫你的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.32,0:20:40.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}騷得不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:44.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}請別這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.06,0:21:20.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我會幫你的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.34,0:21:23.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}請別這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.18,0:22:07.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}太美味了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.14,0:22:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}太好聞了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.70,0:23:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}啊 忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.26,0:24:16.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我 今天不想出門了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.60,0:24:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}這個..
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.60,0:24:30.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}如果能幫上你丈夫的忙 就請收下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.45,0:25:22.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}這次找的醫生好像是個名醫哦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.65,0:25:25.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}聽說開發出了新的治療方法
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.48,0:25:29.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}先不說這個..
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.35,0:25:34.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我已經不想..
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.31,0:25:37.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}不想再給你增加更多負擔了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.34,0:25:43.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}不僅讓你給我做飯..
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.86,0:25:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}那個新的治療方法 也很花錢對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.14,0:25:54.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}所以..
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.25,0:25:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}所以什麼啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.76,0:26:01.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我這病治不好就不治了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.88,0:26:09.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}還有這些美味..我儘是給你增加負擔
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.42,0:26:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我真的..
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.72,0:26:13.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}很沒用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.54,0:26:19.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你這什麼意思啊 難道你不明白我有多擔心你嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.32,0:26:25.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}真沒想到你卻這麼想 你不是說一定會養好病的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.41,0:26:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}算了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.79,0:26:54.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}老公 你沒事吧 振作一點
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.67,0:27:30.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}喂
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.10,0:27:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我是大橋 前些日子真是對不住啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.26,0:27:41.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}如果你方便的話 可以再見個面嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.36,0:27:49.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我今天已經下班了 因為有點事情..
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.07,0:27:52.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.96,0:27:58.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}那改天吧 我只是想支持夫人你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.96,0:28:04.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}今天 還是算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.35,0:28:08.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}真的 非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.08,0:28:13.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}那好吧 你想來的時候就請聯繫我
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.03,0:29:07.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}今天疼痛更劇烈了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.39,0:29:12.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我應該 已經治不好了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.76,0:29:17.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我現在 已經不能再給你添負擔了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.24,0:29:22.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我一直在和絕望作鬥爭
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.49,0:29:39.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}真沒想到..
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.59,0:29:42.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你會主動來找我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.85,0:29:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}真是詫異啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.06,0:29:54.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我丈夫他 昨天 住院了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.83,0:29:58.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}新的治療 也已經開始了..
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.41,0:30:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.31,0:30:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}不過你真的就只是為了那個才來的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.47,0:30:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}畢竟你..
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.73,0:30:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}也是個女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.67,0:30:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你丈夫他現在..
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.20,0:30:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}沒辦法滿足你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.04,0:30:37.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}所以你來了對吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.58,0:31:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}其實你..
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.12,0:31:22.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}這個身體已經飢渴難耐了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.89,0:33:04.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}制服會弄髒的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.39,0:33:37.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你明白的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.80,0:33:53.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你明白的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.34,0:35:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}屁股也給我瞧瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.24,0:36:32.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}好臀
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.00,0:36:46.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}像這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.16,0:37:58.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你怎麼了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.45,0:38:10.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}是這兒嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.01,0:38:22.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}還有這個翹臀..
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.47,0:38:30.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你是為了什麼才來的啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.75,0:39:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}連裏面都看得一清二楚哦
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.68,0:39:22.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}屁眼兒的深處
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.15,0:40:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}現在哪裏被舔了啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.06,0:40:25.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}哪裏被舔了啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.47,0:40:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我說不出口
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.44,0:40:32.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}為什麼不能說啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.75,0:40:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}既然你都來了..
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.59,0:40:50.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}就坦率地把你的全部都秀出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.18,0:40:55.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}哪裏被舔了？
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.29,0:41:25.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}看來你沒辦法回答啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.34,0:41:29.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}不過這裏一抽一抽的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.34,0:42:03.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}汁滴下來了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.94,0:42:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我好像聽到淫蕩的聲音了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.21,0:43:12.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}臉對著我
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.83,0:43:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}自己把腿叉開
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.84,0:44:30.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}沒關係的 叫出來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.28,0:44:59.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你自己瞧瞧啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.75,0:45:31.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}是你主動來的不是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.93,0:45:35.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}來
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.10,0:46:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}給我爽吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.50,0:47:42.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}對
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.02,0:47:50.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}再往裏塞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.47,0:48:06.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}好了 繼續
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.74,0:49:41.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}接下來又要怎麼辦？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.78,0:50:01.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}要怎麼樣？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.25,0:50:09.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.80,0:50:13.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}請回答
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.29,0:50:24.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}請看著我的眼睛回答
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.49,0:50:29.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}這樣可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.42,0:50:33.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}是這樣吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.62,0:50:43.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}說「麻煩您了」
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.33,0:50:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}麻煩您了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.12,0:53:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你的身體都在顫抖哦
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.56,0:54:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.80,0:54:56.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}沒必要忍啊
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.93,0:55:56.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}對 就這樣
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.30,0:56:55.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}沒必要忍耐啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.66,0:59:31.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}好好看著我
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.49,1:00:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}來 看著我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.07,1:01:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}啊 忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.92,1:02:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}住院費用就讓我給你報吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.44,1:02:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你丈夫他現在..
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.04,1:02:50.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}沒辦法滿足你
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.89,1:03:07.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}今天沒什麼時間  就在這兒做吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.31,1:06:00.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}對 看著我口吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.55,1:06:48.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}就是這節奏
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.15,1:07:10.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}對 就這節奏
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.28,1:07:41.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}很好
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.81,1:07:46.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你挺懂的嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.80,1:09:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}這裏已經騷樣難耐了吧
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.32,1:09:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}飢渴了對吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.98,1:10:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我媳婦兒最喜歡這個了啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.67,1:10:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}她總是要我用這個啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.57,1:10:14.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}好了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:15.62,1:10:17.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}接下來..
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.73,1:11:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}好熱
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.30,1:11:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}好熱
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.36,1:11:14.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}太熱了 忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.51,1:11:34.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}不行了 好癢 好癢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.74,1:11:49.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}裏面 好熱 好癢啊
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.41,1:12:02.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}啊 不要
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.79,1:12:40.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}差不多想要真貨了對嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.37,1:14:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}病情開始好轉了啊 醫生說出院只是時間問題了
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.27,1:14:54.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}太好了呢 抱歉我平時沒怎麼來看你
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.47,1:14:59.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}只要能看到真美你開心 就是對我最好的治療藥啊 謝謝你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.94,1:15:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}怎麼了 我今天沒叫你過來啊
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.13,1:15:22.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我丈夫明天就要出院了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.55,1:15:25.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}所以 那個..
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.47,1:15:29.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}想結束這種關係嗎
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.44,1:15:31.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}是這麼回事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.68,1:15:45.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我一直以來都在支持你
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.85,1:15:48.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}也在支持著你丈夫
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.23,1:15:53.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}對於這些 我衷心感謝您
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.74,1:16:01.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}對我來說 醫療費什麼的 根本不算什麼
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.16,1:16:05.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}不過..
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.10,1:16:09.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}一想到以後再也見不到你..
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.90,1:16:13.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}我就感到無比遺憾
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.75,1:16:21.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}好不容易才改變了你啊..
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.24,1:16:26.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}沒錯
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.86,1:16:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你和我產生關係後 就成了一個為慾望而活的女人了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.17,1:16:42.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你體會到了性愛的喜悅
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.34,1:16:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}變成了忠於本能的女人啊
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.89,1:20:43.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}請舔我這裏吧
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.44,1:21:54.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}今天也有一股濃濃的騷香啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.74,1:22:03.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}把騷穴露出來
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.97,1:25:53.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}爽啊
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.30,1:28:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}啊  這腰扭得好圓潤啊
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.65,1:29:30.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}啊 忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.16,1:30:51.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}啊 好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.62,1:31:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}整個穴都在抽搐啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.16,1:32:09.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}啊 好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.41,1:32:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}想高潮就高潮吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.90,1:32:24.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}啊 好舒服 不行了 高潮了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.16,1:33:14.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}對 就這樣
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.86,1:33:33.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}啊 好舒服
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.63,1:36:46.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}這次換後入吧
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.28,1:38:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}啊 高潮了 高潮了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:30.52,1:38:32.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}雞巴在這兒哦
Dialogue: 0,1:39:05.06,1:39:06.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}插進去\N進去了哦
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.22,1:39:14.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}抬腿
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.31,1:43:54.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}現在..
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.55,1:43:58.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}你也已經..
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.87,1:44:01.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}沒有負擔了呢
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.39,1:44:44.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.07,1:44:48.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}為了慶祝你康復 偶爾也去合宿一下吧
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.39,1:44:53.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&HF5FCFE&\3c&H0080FF&}沒問題嗎 今天不是要工作嗎
